    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B02",
      "act": "point-1",
      "narration_text": "The first thing that makes it work is phase gating: each step has to finish before the next one opens, so the model never skips straight to an answer.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "ClaudeComposerAsk",
          "props": {
            "greeting": "",
            "topic": "MEDHAVY · STEM/AI",
            "segment": "Phase-Gating",
            "command": "What makes it phase-gated?",
            "runningText": "checking…",
            "folderLabel": "@HumanitariansAI",
            "output": [
              "Each step gates the next. No skipping ahead."
            ]
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B02.mp4",
            "at": "2026-09-24T18:23:07.917498+00:00"
          }
        }
      },
      "audio_file": "mp3/beat-B02.mp3",
      "actual_duration_s": 8.38,
      "render_duration_s": 8.4,
      "build": {
        "status": "VIDEO",
        "src": "media\\B02.mp4",
        "filled_by": "remotion:ClaudeComposerAsk",
        "at": "2026-09-24T14:36:13"
      }
    },
    {
      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "point-2",
      "narration_text": "The second is fallback behavior: I wrote down exactly what happens when an idea does not fit any existing command, instead of leaving that undefined.",
      "voice": "af_bella",
      "engine": "kokoro",
      "shot": {
        "type": "GRAPHIC",
        "source": "remotion",
        "remotion": {
          "pattern": "ClaudeComposerAsk",
          "props": {
            "greeting": "",
            "topic": "MEDHAVY · STEM/AI",
            "segment": "Fallback Behavior",
            "command": "What happens when nothing fits?",
            "runningText": "checking…",
            "folderLabel": "@HumanitariansAI",
            "output": [
              "A defined fallback beats an undefined gap."
            ]
          },
          "rendered": {
            "out": "media/B03.mp4",
